{
  "date": "2025-05-02",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하이!",
      "en": "Hi!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나는 friend zone",
      "en": "I like Friend Zone,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우어불",
      "en": "Firework Diary,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋아함",
      "en": "those are my favorites."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이정돈 말해도 되겠징?",
      "en": "I can say this much, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "럽투럽은 내평소 스탈은 아닌데 특정 내파트",
      "en": "Love2Love isn't usually my kind of song, but there's one particular part of mine"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "녹음잘한거같아서",
      "en": "that I think I recorded really well,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋음",
      "en": "so I like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "추리소설!",
      "en": "Detective Soseol!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음",
      "en": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "매력있지",
      "en": "That one has its charm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어우불이군아 ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "Oh, it's Firework Diary. ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어우불도 녹음 잘한듯 ,,?",
      "en": "I think I recorded Firework Diary pretty well too...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아마",
      "en": "Probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 지금 듣고있지롱~ ~ ~ ~~",
      "en": "I'm listening to it right now~~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "메롱~~~",
      "en": "Merong~~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어우불담엔 뭘들을까~~~?",
      "en": "What should I listen to after Firework Dairy~~~?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "놀리지마!",
      "en": "Don’t tease me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "놀리지 말을까? ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "Should I stop teasing you? ㅎㅎ"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음아",
      "en": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음음음",
      "en": "Hmm, hmm, hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "몰들을까..~",
      "en": "What should I listen to next..~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅎㅎㅎㅎ",
      "en": "ㅎㅎㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "12일에",
      "en": "On the 12th,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "많은것이",
      "en": "a lot of things"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "공개되겠군",
      "en": "will finally be revealed."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 요새 키 커진거 같은데?",
      "en": "HaYeon, I feel like you've gotten taller lately?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞아!!",
      "en": "I have!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀 큼",
      "en": "I grew a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "넥스트 초반에 주빈이랑 똑같다가",
      "en": "At the beginning of NXT, JooBin and I were the same height,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "주빈이가 좀더 커졌는데",
      "en": "then JooBin got a little taller,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "따라잡음",
      "en": "but I caught up."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "주빈이가",
      "en": "JooBin was like,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니!!! 키컸어?!!!!!",
      "en": "\"Unnie!!! Did you get taller?!!!!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "라며",
      "en": "she said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "견제 하더라고~",
      "en": "acting all competitive about it~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "주빈아 걱정마",
      "en": "Don't worry, JooBin."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나의 성장판의 마지막 발악이였을거야",
      "en": "It was probably just my growth plates making one last desperate effort."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 요즘",
      "en": "Come to think of it, lately..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "막",
      "en": "I've been"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쉴새없이 배고프고",
      "en": "constantly hungry,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "졸리고 하던게",
      "en": "and sleepy all the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "키크려고 한건가",
      "en": "Maybe it was because I was growing taller."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벌크업하나봐",
      "en": "I guess I'm bulking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 저번에",
      "en": "The other day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "샵에서 갑자기",
      "en": "at the salon,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "김채원이랑",
      "en": "ChaeWon"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "공유빈언니가",
      "en": "and YuBin unnie"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "둘이 날 계속 쳐다보는겨",
      "en": "kept staring at me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 왜?",
      "en": "So I asked, \"Why?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러니까",
      "en": "Then they said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너 되게 건강미있다",
      "en": "\"You look really healthy.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 얘길했는데",
      "en": "That's what they told me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "결국 우락부락해졌다는걸",
      "en": "but what they really meant was that I'd gotten all buff."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "돌려 말한거임",
      "en": "They were just saying it indirectly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋㅎㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㅎ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋㅎㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㅎ"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근육이 너무 쪄서",
      "en": "I've put on so much muscle."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 또 근육이에요~하고 찐게 아니라 지방뒤에 숨어서",
      "en": "But it's not the kind where you can go, 'Yep, that's muscle.' It's hiding underneath fat."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "비겁하게!!!!",
      "en": "What a coward!!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우락부락하연",
      "en": "Buff HaYeon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나쁘지",
      "en": "That's not"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "않아",
      "en": "so bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그 소두 곰인형일지",
      "en": "Like those teddy bears with tiny heads,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그거처럼",
      "en": "you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "몸을 키우는거지",
      "en": "I'll just keep making the body bigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어때",
      "en": "How's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "나중에 옵젝에서 근육 자랑 포즈해주는거야?",
      "en": "Then later, are you going to do a muscle-flexing pose for an Objekt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촬영전에",
      "en": "Before the shoot,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "푸쉬업막 하고 들어가고",
      "en": "I'll do a bunch of push-ups first."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "매력적인데? 오히려좋아",
      "en": "Honestly, that sounds pretty appealing. I actually like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 그리고",
      "en": "Oh, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "만약 나한테 예명을 쓸수있게 했다면",
      "en": "If I had been allowed to use a stage name,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "루나를 했을듯",
      "en": "I probably would've chosen Luna."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "의식의",
      "en": "That was just"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "흐름이다",
      "en": "a random train of thought."
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안녕하세요 트리플에스 루나입네다!",
      "en": "Hello! I'm tripleS Luna!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엇",
      "en": "Oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "갑자기",
      "en": "Suddenly,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "국적이",
      "en": "it feels like"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "바뀐느낌이",
      "en": "my nationality changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "토리풀에수에소 활똥하눈 루나입네다!",
      "en": "\"I am Luna, promoting in toripleS!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말씨가 이러한 이유는 그거슨….",
      "en": "The reason I talk like this is because..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "루나가 외국에서 오래살다와서",
      "en": "Luna lived abroad for a long time,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한국말이",
      "en": "so her Korean"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "서툰가봐",
      "en": "must not be very fluent."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "집 보냈어 웅웅",
      "en": "Alright, I sent her home. Yep, yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "잘해써~ 시간이 늦엇는데",
      "en": "Good job~ It's getting late though."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러니까~ 조심히가 루나~!",
      "en": "Exactly~ Get home safely, Luna~!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "루나인 이유",
      "en": "As for why I picked Luna..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모르는",
      "en": "For anyone who doesn't know,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사람을위해 말해주자면",
      "en": "I'll explain."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "귀여운 초등학교 4학년때",
      "en": "Back when I was an adorable fourth grader,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "영어학원에서",
      "en": "at my English academy,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지은 내",
      "en": "I came up with"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "영어이름",
      "en": "my English name."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "4학년이",
      "en": "Was it fourth grade?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니였니",
      "en": "Or wasn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나",
      "en": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쨋든",
      "en": "Anyway."
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "진짜 초딩이 지을만한 이름임",
      "en": "That really is the kind of name an elementary school kid would come up with."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리 엄마가 추천한건데….",
      "en": "My mom was the one who recommended it...."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "어쩐지 ㅋㅋㅋ 너무 예쁘더라고",
      "en": "No wonder. ㅋㅋㅋ It's actually a really pretty name."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋ 뻥인데",
      "en": "ㅋ I'm kidding."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "근데 루나 잘 어울려 모드하우스 아이돌로 좋은 이름임",
      "en": "But Luna really suits you. It'd be a great name for a MODHAUS idol."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 ㅇ운명처럼",
      "en": "It really feels like fate."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 혹시 도를 아십니까 당해본적있어?",
      "en": "HaYeon, have you ever been approached by one of those 'Do you know...' cult recruiters?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "나 오늘 당했는데 ㄹㅇ 황당.,.",
      "en": "It happened to me today. It was seriously ridiculous..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도 당할뻔한적은 있음",
      "en": "I've almost been approached before too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "당할뻔?",
      "en": "Well... almost."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 말을걸길래",
      "en": "Someone just started talking to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아주머니 셨는데",
      "en": "It was an older lady."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나한테 학생이야?",
      "en": "She asked me, 'Are you a student?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하셔서",
      "en": "So,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "길물어보시려는줄 알고",
      "en": "I thought she was going to ask for directions,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "멈춰서",
      "en": "so I stopped."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "네네!",
      "en": "\"Yes!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이랬는데",
      "en": "That's what I said."
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "학생이 지금 하고있는 일들이 잘 맞지",
      "en": "\"Don't you feel like the things you're doing right now don't really suit you?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "않는다는생각이 들지않냐",
      "en": "\"Have you ever felt that way?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머 이런 ㅇ얘기",
      "en": "She was about to say something like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하려고 했던거같은데",
      "en": "I think that's where she was going with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촉 딱",
      "en": "But I immediately got a bad feeling."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와서",
      "en": "So..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "죄송해요 지금 급한일있ㅇ서",
      "en": "\"I'm sorry, but I'm in a hurry right now.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이라면서",
      "en": "I said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빠져나옴",
      "en": "and got out of there."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "사실 진짜 진로상담 해줄려는거면 어캐",
      "en": "But what if she was actually trying to give you career advice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아하!",
      "en": "Ah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한창 학원 다닐때니까",
      "en": "I was still going to academy all the time back then,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "고1이였을듯",
      "en": "so I think I was in my first year of high school."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연아 길거리에서 모르는 아저씨가 아이스크림 먹으러가자 하면 꼭 안돼요! 라고해라 알찌?",
      "en": "HaYeon, if some stranger on the street asks you to go get ice cream with him, make sure you say, 'No!' Okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안대여!!",
      "en": "No!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아이스크림 먹으러 가자!",
      "en": "Let's go get some ice cream!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "죠아",
      "en": "Okay."
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "안대요~ 해야지",
      "en": "You're supposed to say, 'No~!'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안대여!!",
      "en": "No!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하겐다즈 사줄게",
      "en": "I'll buy you Häagen-Dazs."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "죠…죠…….좋아.",
      "en": "O-Okay..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이건 못참지",
      "en": "I can't resist that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자깜만여",
      "en": "Hang on a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "친구들도",
      "en": "I'll bring my friends"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "데리고 올께여",
      "en": "with me too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "23명인데 갠차나여?",
      "en": "There are 23 of them. Is that okay?"
    },
